- operator-wallet: OperatorWalletPort.withdrawToSteward + Privy impl (fixed ERC-20
  transfer to config-pinned stewardAddress) + ERC20_TRANSFER_ABI
- node-shared: PAYMENTS_STEWARD_WITHDRAWAL event
- app: /api/v1/payments/steward-withdrawal route (session + steward-self-authorized),
  (admin)/admin/payments OpenRouter Funding panel, admin landing card, shared/config
  getStewardWalletConfig + isDaoAdmin, fake wallet adapter, container stewardAddress wiring
- .cogni/repo-spec.yaml: payments_out.steward_wallet = Derek's admin wallet

